			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in physics!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in economics!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in engineering!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in nanotechnology!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in genetics!"`
			`"Happiness. I'm about to graduate with my mastery in aerodynamics!"`
			`"Enthusiasm. I can't wait to go into academia after I graduate! I have a position lined up and everything!"`
